      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹6.02 (up from ₹4.65 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.47b (up 3.7% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹107.7m (up 30% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 4.4% (up from 3.5% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 11% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 24% per year, which means it is performing significantly worse than earnings.",
