      "body": "Butterfly Gandhimathi Appliances Limited announced the resignation of Mr. Shantanu Khosla, Non-Executive, Non-Independent Director of the Company (DIN: 00059877), who was appointed as the authorised representative of Crompton Greaves Consumer Electricals Limited (\"Crompton\"), the holding company of the Company and whose tenure on the Board of Crompton ended on December 31, 2025 and has tendered his resignation from the Board of the Company as well on December 09, 2025 with effect from the close of business hours on December 31, 2025.",
